    "fullHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <title>서울아트마켓 등록안내 & 혜택 가이드</title>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] p-6 font-sans antialiased w-full\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 w-full text-[#000000] dark:text-white\">\n    <!-- Top Benefit Card -->\n    <div class=\"bg-[#f6f6f6] dark:bg-slate-800/80 rounded-sm p-6 sm:p-[30px] flex flex-col gap-0 border-0 w-full\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.8px] text-[#000000] dark:text-white leading-7\">\n        2026 서울아트마켓 개인등록 혜택\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"border-t border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-slate-700 mt-5 pt-5 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-3xl bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-[14px] font-normal flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 leading-6\">1</span>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal text-[#000000] dark:text-slate-200 leading-[22.4px] tracking-[-0.8px]\">모든 PAMS 프로그램 참여 가능</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[15px] font-normal text-[#000000] dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-[21px] tracking-[-0.8px]\">* 단, 일부 프로그램의 경우 선착순 또는 사전예약으로 입장이 제한될 수 있음</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-3xl bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-[14px] font-normal flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 leading-6\">2</span>\n          <p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal text-[#000000] dark:text-slate-200 leading-[22.4px] tracking-[-0.8px]\">2026 서울아트마켓 참가자(델리게이트) 정보 제공</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-3xl bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-[14px] font-normal flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 leading-6\">3</span>\n          <p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal text-[#000000] dark:text-slate-200 leading-[22.4px] tracking-[-0.8px]\">서울아트마켓 프로그램북 제공 등</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- CTA Button -->\n    <div class=\"flex justify-end pt-3 w-full\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-5 h-[50px] min-w-[160px] border border-[#000000] dark:border-white rounded-none text-[18px] font-medium tracking-[-0.8px] text-[#000000] dark:text-white hover:bg-[#000000] hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n        <span>개인등록 바로가기</span> &rarr;\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Guide Table -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 mt-2 w-full\">\n      <div class=\"text-[#cccccc] dark:text-slate-600 text-[36px] sm:text-[55px] font-normal leading-[55px] tracking-[-0.3px] font-mono\">REGISTRATION GUIDE</div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-[#000000] dark:text-white text-[24px] sm:text-[30px] font-semibold leading-[42px] tracking-[-0.8px] mt-1 mb-4\">2026 서울아트마켓 등록안내</h2>\n      <div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-none border-t-2 border-[#444444] dark:border-slate-200\">\n        <table class=\"w-full min-w-[760px] text-center text-[16px] border-collapse rounded-none border-b border-[#dddddd] dark:border-slate-700\">\n          <thead class=\"bg-[#f6f6f6] dark:bg-slate-800 text-[#000000] dark:text-white font-semibold border-b border-[#dddddd] dark:border-slate-700\">\n            <tr class=\"h-[48px]\">\n              <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-[#dddddd] dark:border-slate-700 tracking-[-0.8px]\">구분</th>\n              <th class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-[#dddddd] dark:border-slate-700 tracking-[-0.8px]\">등록기간</th>\n              <th class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-[#dddddd] dark:border-slate-700 w-24 tracking-[-0.8px]\">할인율</th>\n              <th class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-[#dddddd] dark:border-